  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>72</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> long wire <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> as shown in&nbsp;the figure. The galvanometer jockey is placed at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>. The&nbsp;galvanometer shows zero deflection.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a7fa89a5-4202-48fb-8d54-fedcec0900ac-image.png\" style=\"width: 366px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, to the nearest integer, is</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "48",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In balanced conditions,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>72</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>.</p>",
